 ['Cookie Clicker','idle cookies tapping strategy','Bake endless cookies and build an empire.','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CoolDude2349/Offline-HTML-Games-Pack/refs/heads/master/offline/cookie-clicker.htm'],
