 ['Among Us','impostor social deduction multiplayer space','Complete tasks and find the impostor.','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CoolDude2349/Offline-HTML-Games-Pack/refs/heads/master/offline/among-us.html'],
 ['Baldi’s Basics','school math horror adventure','Answer questions and escape the school.','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CoolDude2349/Offline-HTML-Games-Pack/refs/heads/master/offline/baldis-basics.html'],
 ['Backrooms','horror escape liminal maze','Explore the endless halls and find a way out.','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CoolDude2349/Offline-HTML-Games-Pack/refs/heads/master/offline/backrooms.html'],
 ['BitLife','life simulator choices career family','Make choices and build a life.','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CoolDude2349/Offline-HTML-Games-Pack/refs/heads/master/offline/bitlife.html'],
 ['Drive Mad','driving racing car obstacle arcade','Balance your vehicle and reach the finish line.','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CoolDude2349/Offline-HTML-Games-Pack/refs/heads/master/offline/drive-mad.htm'],
